# Build artifacts
/bin/
# goreleaser writes here
/dist/

# Coverage
/coverage.out
/coverage.html

# Go
*.test
*.out

# Editor / OS
.DS_Store
*.swp
*.swo
.idea/
.vscode/

# Local config / secrets
*.local.yaml
.env
.env.*

# Project credentials store — gaia auth --project writes to
# .gaia/credentials.yaml (mode 0600, holds the forge PAT).
# Structural protection so the credential never depends on the
# runtime auth flow being used in a specific way. The trailing
# glob catches rotation conventions: credentials.bak, credentials_old,
# credentials.json, credentialsBACKUP, etc. auth.EnsureGitignored
# stays as belt-and-braces for repos that don't already have it.
.gaia/credentials*

# Per-clone usage log: telemetry of which gaia commands the
# operator runs vs falls back to curl/etc. Local-only; stays out
# of git so it doesn't pollute history with workstation noise.
.gaia-usage.jsonl

# Top-level binaries: produced by `go build ./cmd/gaia` or
# `go build ./cmd/gaia-mcp` without -o (which writes to cwd, not bin/).
/gaia
/gaia-mcp
